<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR CAMPUS FOOD DIARY</view><view class="title">我的食光</view><view class="subtitle">把喜欢的味道留在这里。</view><view wx:if="{{!logged}}" class="panel"><view class="big-emoji">🍽️</view><view class="section-title">欢迎 校园食客</view><view class="notice">{{mode==='demo'?'体验身份仅在本机保存，不关联微信账号。':'使用微信云开发身份登录，不读取手机号。'}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">{{mode==='demo'?'使用体验身份登录':'微信身份登录'}}</button></view><block wx:else><view class="panel"><view class="row"><view><view class="section-title">{{user.nickname}}</view><text class="badge">{{badge}}</text><view class="muted mt">{{progress.next?'再获得'+progress.remaining+'分，解锁'+progress.next:'已获得最高等级勋章'}}</view></view><button class="small" bindtap="logout">退出</button></view><view class="stats"><view><text>{{points}}</text>积分</view><view><text>{{favoritesCount}}</text>收藏</view><view><text>{{reviewsCount}}</text>评价</view></view></view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{tab===item.id?'on':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tab">{{item.name}}</view></view><block wx:if="{{tab==='favorites'}}"><dish-list items="{{items}}" bind:changed="update"/><view class="panel" wx:if="{{windows.length}}"><view wx:for="{{windows}}" wx:key="id" class="record row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><view class="wrap"><button class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="window">看菜品</button><button class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="unfavorite">取消收藏</button></view></view></view></block><view wx:if="{{tab==='reviews'||tab==='crowds'}}" class="panel"><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view>{{item.name}} · {{item.statusText}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.text}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.reason}}">原因：{{item.reason}}</view><button wx:if="{{tab==='reviews'}}" class="small mt" data-id="{{item.dishId}}" bindtap="openReview">查看菜品与修改评价</button><view class="muted" wx:else>{{item.date}} · {{item.active?'有效中':'已过期'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="muted">还没有记录，去留下你的第一条食堂记忆吧。</view></view><view wx:if="{{tab==='settings'}}" class="panel"><view class="field"><text class="field-title">昵称</text><input value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="20"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-title">偏好口味</text><picker range="{{tastes}}" value="{{tasteIndex}}" data-field="tasteIndex" bindchange="picker">{{tastes[tasteIndex]}}</picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-title">荤素偏好</text><picker range="{{diets}}" value="{{dietIndex}}" data-field="dietIndex" bindchange="picker">{{diets[dietIndex]}}</picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-title">最高辣度</text><picker range="{{spices}}" value="{{spiceIndex}}" data-field="spiceIndex" bindchange="picker">{{spices[spiceIndex]}}</picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-title">避开这些食材</text><checkbox-group bindchange="avoid"><label class="check-label" wx:for="{{allergens}}" wx:key="name"><checkbox value="{{item.name}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#e45d3b"/>{{item.name}}</label></checkbox-group></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save">保存偏好</button><view class="divider"></view><view class="section-title">饭点提醒</view><view class="notice">演示模式不发送消息。微信版需要模板和每次授权，一次授权发送一次。</view><view class="wrap"><button class="small" data-time="11:30" bindtap="subscribe">午餐 11:30</button><button class="small" data-time="17:30" bindtap="subscribe">晚餐 17:30</button><button class="small" bindtap="unsubscribe">关闭</button></view></view></block><button class="small mt" bindtap="openAdmin">管理工作台</button><view class="notice">通过审核的评价加5分，每天前5次上报各加2分；食材标签仅供选择参考。</view><view class="wrap mt"><button class="primary" bindtap="openPlan">🗓 就餐计划与周预算</button><button class="small" bindtap="openCompare">⇄ 菜品对比</button></view><view class="owner">个人中心负责人 · 李付远<view></view>登录订阅负责人 · 范星宇</view></view>
